  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When retrieving results, currently the membership and containment services both query for the complete set of results and then build a stream out of the resulting List. For containers with very large numbers of children/members, this can cause the application to run out of memory.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We should update these services to avoid having to load the full set into memory, streaming from the database instead. Possible approaches could include generating a stream from a cursor or internally performing paging, etc.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
