  "description": "<p>When retrieving results, currently the membership and containment services both query for the complete set of results and then build a stream out of the resulting List. For containers with very large numbers of children/members, this can cause the application to run out of memory.</p>\n\n<p>We should update these services to avoid having to load the full set into memory, streaming from the database instead. Possible approaches could include generating a stream from a cursor or internally performing paging, etc.</p>",
